utcome would land below the interval if receipts are under 209.4 thousand. An outside the interval high print would most likely require a broad policy-driven filing surge rather than normal trend.\\\"},{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"forecast\\\",\\\"point\\\":239.4,\\\"ciLow\\\":209.4,\\\"ciHigh\\\":269.4}]}\"}}\n./records/thesis-analyst/2026-07-08/2026-07-08t21-21-56z-ssa-dds-initial-disability-receipts-2027-04/codex_events.jsonl:13:{\"type\": \"item.started\", \"item\": {\"id\": \"item_5\", \"type\": \"command_execution\", \"command\": \"/bin/zsh -lc 'rg \\\"ssdi-initial-applications-april-2027|ssa.dds.initial_disability_receipts\\\" -n site records docs scripts agents | head -50'\", \"aggregated_output\": \"\", \"exit_code\": null, \"status\": \"in_progress\"}}\n./records/thesis-analyst/2026-07-08/2026-07-08t21-21-56z-ssa-dds-initial-disability-receipts-2027-04/codex_events.jsonl:14:{\"type\": \"item.completed\", \"item\": {\"id\": \"item_5\", \"type\": \"command_execution\", \"command\": \"/bin/zsh -lc 'rg \\\"ssdi-initial-applications-april-2027|ssa.dds.initial_disability_receipts\\\" -n site records docs scripts agents | head -50'\", \"aggregated_output\": \"records/thesis-analyst/2026-07-08/2026-07-08t21-21-56z-ssa-dds-initial-disability-receipts-2027-04/revision_prompt.md:11:- series: ssa.dds.initial_disability_receipts\\nrecords/thesis-analyst/2026-07-08/2026-07-08t21-21-56z-ssa-dds-initial-disability-receipts-2027-04/revision_prompt.md:17:- catalogSlug: \\\"ssdi-initial-applications-april-2027-work-req-deadline-holds\\\"\\nrecords/thesis-analyst/2026-07-08/2026-07-08t21-21-56z-ssa-dds-initial-disability-receipts-2027-04/revision_prompt.md:125:{\\\"slug\\\":\\\"ssdi-initial-applications-april-2027-work-req-deadline-holds\\\",\\\"country\\\":\\\"US\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"conditional\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"SSDI initial applications, Apr 2027\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"Social Security Administration State Agency Monthly Workload Data, Field I Receipts (All Initial), SSA month 2