: this forecast targets SSA State Agency Monthly Workload Data monthly Field I, Receipts (All Initial), for SSA month 2027-04. The variant is not seasonally adjusted DDS/state-agency initial claims, not OASDI beneficiary stocks, not SSI Monthly Statistics, and not final revised annual claims workloads.\"},{\"kind\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"official.lookup\",\"call\":\"Opened SSA State Agency Monthly Workload Data documentation and data dictionary.\",\"result\":\"Fetched official dataset facts: monthly data start in October 2000; the expanded current file has 71 data elements; Field I is Receipts (All Initial); Fields I-M cover All Initial Claims; data are one row per State Code and Date; no summary row is provided; File Version currently has value 2.\"},{\"kind\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"official.lookup\",\"call\":\"Opened SSA State Agency Monthly Workload Data timing and update-policy documentation.\",\"result\":\"Fetched timing evidence: SSA counts monthly work in weekly increments, an SSA month normally ends on the last Friday of the month, the Date field maps to SSA time periods, and the dataset is updated with a new time period within 30 days of the close of the prior time period; April 2027's last Friday is 2027-04-30, so the official within-30-days by-date is 2027-05-30.\"},{\"kind\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"official.lookup\",\"call\":\"Opened Annual Statistical Supplement 2025 Agency Workloads, Table 2.F5 and 2.F6, for latest official claim-volume anchor.\",\"result\":\"Fetched fiscal year 2024 claims workloads: Disability Insurance claims received total 2,260.6 thousand, worker 2,145.9 thousand, family members and survivors 114.7 thousand; SSI claims received total 1,683.2 thousand, aged 214.1 thousand, blind or disabled 1,469.1 thousand.\"},{\"kind\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"official.lookup\",\"call\":\"Opened Annual Statistical Supplement 2024 Claims Workloads, Table 2.F5 and 2.F6, for prior-year official anchor.\",\"result\":\"Fetched fiscal year 2023 claims workloads: Disa